  "prefLabel": "He-C 6430.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 6430.02 Scope. These rules shall apply to any person or entity seeking a confirmation of whether or not an individual’s name is listed on the central registry or seeking expungement from the central registry pursuant to RSA 169-C:35, IV.\n\nSource. #8594, eff 3-28-06; ss by #10692, eff 10-14-14; ss by #14249, eff 5-20-25, EXPIRES: 5-20-35",
